{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_64787EC0","title":"Deeala Intro","entry":"Dlg_64787EC0::entry","exit":"Dlg_64787EC0::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_1C469F70","articyId":"72057624102699924","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"Are you the manager? My food is taking forever. I'm hungry. I'm tired. I've been up since... well, since yesterday.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you the manager? My food is taking forever. I'm hungry. I'm tired. I've been up since... well, since yesterday.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":350.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44553","byteOffset":31185472,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_B7FD683A","articyId":"72057619807733869","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"It smells good. I'm so hungry. And tired. I can barely keep my eyes open. Or my mouth shut. Sorry for snapping.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It smells good. I'm so hungry. And tired. I can barely keep my eyes open. Or my mouth shut. Sorry for snapping.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":950.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41749","byteOffset":30122184,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_36A7EDF5","articyId":"72057619807733889","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"Believe me, if I was upset, you'd know.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Believe me, if I was upset, you'd know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":950.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21867","byteOffset":16161192,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_2956090A","articyId":"72057619807733903","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"You're probably wondering why I'm so grouchy.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're probably wondering why I'm so grouchy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1550.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16573","byteOffset":14164800,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_E5D5FF1A","articyId":"72057619807733925","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"I've been abusing rich assholes all night. Not physically. Verbally. And emotionally I guess - just a little.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've been abusing rich assholes all night. Not physically. Verbally. And emotionally I guess - just a little.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23164","byteOffset":16647328,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_081953A9","articyId":"72057619807733940","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"No, I work at Mollyphonic, the cyberdelic deepgoth club downtown. Abusing rich assholes is more of a... hobby. A well paid one.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, I work at Mollyphonic, the cyberdelic deepgoth club downtown. Abusing rich assholes is more of a... hobby. A well paid one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2750.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26040","byteOffset":17733192,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_973FF14A","articyId":"72057619807733954","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"It's exhausting. Serving drinks all day. insulting people all night. Sometimes, I wonder how much longer I can keep this up.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's exhausting. Serving drinks all day. insulting people all night. Sometimes, I wonder how much longer I can keep this up.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3348.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51803","byteOffset":34013832,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_EB6C86A4","articyId":"72057619807733975","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"I'm not looking for a side order of awkward flirting with my food... But thanks.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not looking for a side order of awkward flirting with my food... But thanks.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4850.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25763","byteOffset":17630136,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_EC793F88","articyId":"72057619807733989","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Deeala","text":"With customer service like that you'll go far, and I hope you'll stay there.","speakerId":"Ntt_621D2725","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"With customer service like that you'll go far, and I hope you'll stay there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":4850.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23735","byteOffset":16860664,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_A28694E9"